OL,3,AFamily blame police for 'Putney pusher'
OL,4,Asuspect's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met said it recognised the "strain
OL,7,Fthat being subject to a police
OL,8,Finvestigation" could cause, and that a
OL,9,Fmandatory referral had been made to the
OL,10,Fpolice watchdog. The force said the
OL,11,Finvestigation into the 2017 incident
OL,12,Fremained ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
